      "attributeId": "SidePanels",
      "status": "unbound",
      "reason": "As in Urban Freestanding: the scene takes SidePanel together with SidePanelSide; the side comes from SidePanelLeft/SidePanelRight, so one value cannot make the patch, and sidePanels.ts builds it. Tricot offers the panel without a groove (NoG) only. Export v44 has a Tricot_SidePanel template but registers no product for it and gives the Tricot products no sidePanelSupport, so the scene stands its legacy panels beside them, which take the Urban Standard Height heights (50/53/56) only."
    },
